 "summary": "BAT46WS is a single small-signal Schottky barrier diode in the two-lead SOD-323 surface-mount case. It blocks 100 V, carries 0.15 A average forward current and drops at most 0.25 V at 0.1 mA and 0.45 V at 10 mA. Its maker lists low turn-on voltage and fast switching, for low-voltage high-frequency signal circuits.",
